 "part": "script/script_0045",
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "script:0045:03B8",
   "src": "9855a21f7cc0",
   "t": "<FACE:14>Pero esa Sekiran<NL>era bien guapa, ¿eh?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0045:03D7",
   "src": "078eef830310",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>¿Tú crees?<WAIT>A mí me parece que<NL>solo es puro brillo<WAIT><FACE:19>Eso mismo<NL>Y encima parece tonta<WAIT>A mí me gustan más<NL>las chicas tranquilas"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0045:042E",
   "src": "465509978957",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>Nadie te preguntó<NL>por tus gustos<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0045:0445",
   "src": "08619c53bb8d",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>Por cierto, <PLAYER><NL>¿y tú qué? Que se te<WAIT>estaba insinuando…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0045:0462",
   "src": "b971fb689a7f",
   "t": "<FACE:03>¡¿Eh?!<WAIT><FACE:06>¡Eso! ¿No se te caía<NL>la baba, acaso?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0045:0480",
   "src": "97b225f5471c",
   "t": "<FACE:03>C-claro que no…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0045:048D",
   "src": "37ae7d5c9def",
   "t": "<FACE:70>Nos costó recuperar<NL>este bloque, así que<WAIT>acaben rápido con<NL>ellos"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0045:04AF",
   "src": "029e8302e47b",
   "t": "<FACE:81>P-pero jefa<NL>Sekiran…<WAIT>¿y nosotros cómo<NL>escapamos-robo…?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0045:04D5",
   "src": "ca962ab1ffce",
   "t": "<FACE:70>Tranquilos<WAIT>Si la cosa se pone<NL>fea, los salvo con<WAIT>mi Medabot"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0045:04FE",
   "src": "88d80b1246a4",
   "t": "<FACE:06>Ya están otra vez…<WAIT>¡Ya basta de<NL>tonterías!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0045:0517",
   "src": "4cc2a513b454",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>¡Y-ya vienen-robo!<WAIT>Otra vez esos<NL>tipos-robo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0045:052C",
   "src": "06490445c7f8",
   "t": "<FACE:71>¡Esto pasa porque<NL>ustedes son lentos!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0045:054E",
   "src": "84257cf3546c",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>¿Ves? Te lo dije:<NL>pura pinta e histeria"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0045:0567",
   "src": "73570af99da3",
   "t": "<FACE:18>P-pues igual tienes<NL>razón…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0045:0575",
   "src": "8509109f8e75",
   "t": "<FACE:19>Eso mismo<NL>Está clarísimo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0045:0589",
   "src": "7dd6916fec7d",
   "t": "<FACE:05>Y encima repiten<NL>lo mismo…<WAIT><FACE:09>No aprenden, ¿eh?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0045:05A5",
   "src": "728c73b7f48e",
   "t": "<FACE:71>¡Cállate!<WAIT>Hablan de mí a su<NL>antojo… ¡Van a ver<WAIT>lo que es bueno!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0045:05D1",
   "src": "00614284d43d",
   "t": "<FACE:05>¿Qué tal? ¿Ya<NL>aprendieron?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0045:05E0",
   "src": "3c6cac053c98",
   "t": "<FACE:70>Hmpf… ¡La próxima<NL>no será tan fácil!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0045:05F5",
   "src": "324036d8a1db",
   "t": "<FACE:72>¡Nos vemos otra vez,<NL>mi lindo <DELAY:001E>ni·<DELAY:000F>ñi·<DELAY:000F>to!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0045:0618",
   "src": "016010b9a76b",
   "t": "<FACE:06>¡¿Por qué te pones<NL>rojo?!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0045:0628",
   "src": "1ac31d73e476",
   "t": "<FACE:03>Guh…"
  }
 ]
}
